title Architecture Detection Flow

participant "Discovery Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "Build System Detector" as Build
participant "Cluster Detector" as Cluster
participant "Framework Detector" as Framework
participant "Pattern Detector" as Pattern
participant "Confidence Evaluator" as Confidence
participant "LLM Client" as LLM
participant "Signature Builder" as Signature

note over Pipeline, Signature: === Phase 1: Build System Detection ===

Pipeline->Build: Detect build system
activate Build
Build->Build: Scan for build files
Build->Build: Check settings.gradle.kts
Build->Build: Check pom.xml
Build->Build: Check build.gradle
Build->Build: Check package.json
Build->Build: Check Cargo.toml
Build->Build: Check go.mod
Build->Build: Identify build tool (Gradle, Maven, npm, Cargo, Go)
Build->Build: Detect build configuration
Build-->Pipeline: BuildSystemResult
deactivate Build

note over Pipeline, Signature: === Phase 2: Cluster Detection ===

Pipeline->Cluster: Detect clusters
activate Cluster

Cluster->Cluster: Try build module detection
Cluster->Cluster: Parse settings.gradle.kts
Cluster->Cluster: Extract module declarations
Cluster->Cluster: Identify module boundaries

alt Build modules found
    Cluster->Cluster: Use build modules as clusters
    note right of Cluster: Gradle modules:\n- core:orchestrator\n- core:session\n- launcher\n- etc.
    Cluster-->Pipeline: Cluster list (from build)
else No build modules
    Cluster->Cluster: Fallback to directory structure
    Cluster->Cluster: Scan source directories
    Cluster->Cluster: Detect src/main/kotlin, src/main/java
    Cluster->Cluster: Count source files per directory
    Cluster->Cluster: Group by package structure
    Cluster->Cluster: Create clusters from directories
    note right of Cluster: Directory clusters:\n- com/example/core\n- com/example/api\n- com/example/ui
    Cluster-->Pipeline: Cluster list (from directories)
end

deactivate Cluster

note over Pipeline, Signature: === Phase 3: Per-Cluster Architecture Detection ===

loop For each cluster
    Pipeline->Framework: Detect frameworks
    activate Framework
    Framework->Framework: Scan dependencies
    Framework->Framework: Check for Spring Boot
    Framework->Framework: Check for Ktor
    Framework->Framework: Check for React
    Framework->Framework: Check for Angular
    Framework->Framework: Identify web frameworks
    Framework->Framework: Identify data frameworks (JPA, Hibernate)
    Framework->Framework: Identify testing frameworks (JUnit, TestNG)
    Framework-->Pipeline: FrameworkResult
    deactivate Framework

    Pipeline->Pattern: Detect design patterns
    activate Pattern
    Pattern->Pattern: Analyze class structure
    Pattern->Pattern: Check for Agent classes
    Pattern->Pattern: Check for Orchestrator classes
    Pattern->Pattern: Check for Repository classes
    Pattern->Pattern: Check for Service classes
    Pattern->Pattern: Check for Controller classes
    Pattern->Pattern: Identify Layered Architecture
    Pattern->Pattern: Identify Hexagonal Architecture
    Pattern->Pattern: Identify Agent Architecture
    Pattern->Pattern: Identify Pipeline Architecture
    Pattern->Pattern: Identify Microservices Architecture
    Pattern-->Pipeline: PatternResult
    deactivate Pattern

    Pipeline->Confidence: Calculate confidence
    activate Confidence
    Confidence->Confidence: Evaluate pattern match strength
    Confidence->Confidence: Check framework detection certainty
    Confidence->Confidence: Assess dependency clarity
    Confidence->Confidence: Calculate overall confidence score
    Confidence-->Pipeline: Confidence score (0.0 - 1.0)
    deactivate Confidence

    alt Confidence >= threshold (0.7)
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Accept heuristic result
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Mark source as "heuristic"
        note right of Pipeline: High confidence:\n- Use heuristic detection\n- No LLM needed
    else Confidence < threshold AND useLlmForLowConfidence = true
        Pipeline->LLM: Request LLM analysis
        activate LLM
        LLM->LLM: Analyze cluster structure
        LLM->LLM: Review dependencies
        LLM->LLM: Identify architectural patterns
        LLM->LLM: Generate architecture analysis
        LLM-->Pipeline: LLM result
        deactivate LLM
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Merge heuristic + LLM results
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Mark source as "heuristic+llm"
        note right of Pipeline: Low confidence with LLM:\n- Combine heuristic and LLM\n- Enhanced accuracy
    else Confidence < threshold AND LLM disabled
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Mark as low confidence
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Flag for manual review
        Pipeline->Pipeline: Mark source as "heuristic(low_confidence)"
        note right of Pipeline: Low confidence no LLM:\n- Flag for review\n- Manual intervention needed
    end
end

note over Pipeline, Signature: === Phase 4: Deployment Pattern Detection ===

Pipeline->Signature: Analyze cluster relationships
activate Signature
Signature->Signature: Count total clusters
Signature->Signature: Assess cluster independence
Signature->Signature: Analyze inter-cluster dependencies
Signature->Signature: Evaluate build module structure

alt Single cluster
    Signature->Signature: Monolithic deployment
    note right of Signature: Single cluster:\n- Monolith pattern
else Multiple clusters with high independence
    Signature->Signature: Microservices deployment
    note right of Signature: Independent clusters:\n- Microservices pattern
else Multiple clusters with moderate dependencies
    Signature->Signature: Modular monolith deployment
    note right of Signature: Dependent clusters:\n- Modular monolith pattern
else Hierarchical cluster structure
    Signature->Signature: Layered deployment
    note right of Signature: Hierarchical:\n- Layered pattern
end

Signature-->Pipeline: Deployment pattern
deactivate Signature

note over Pipeline, Signature: === Phase 5: Architecture Signature Generation ===

Pipeline->Signature: Build complete signature
activate Signature
Signature->Signature: Compile build system
Signature->Signature: Compile module frameworks
Signature->Signature: Compile module patterns
Signature->Signature: Compile clusters
Signature->Signature: Compile design patterns
Signature->Signature: Compile language features
Signature->Signature: Compile deployment pattern
Signature->Signature: Compile confidence scores

Signature->Signature: ArchitectureSignature(\n  buildSystem,\n  moduleFrameworks,\n  modulePatterns,\n  clusters,\n  moduleDesignPatterns,\n  deploymentPattern,\n  confidence\n)
Signature-->Pipeline: Complete signature
deactivate Signature

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate architecture-detection.yaml
Pipeline->Pipeline: Save to semantic cache
Pipeline-->Pipeline: Architecture detection complete
